#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:21
msgid "分类任务：发现类别边界的规律"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:23
msgid "想象你在教小孩认动物。你不会给他看一张 checklist，而是指着图片说：\"这个有四条腿、有毛、会汪汪叫，所以是狗。\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:25
msgid "**分类的本质**：找到区分不同类别的**边界**——边界这边是A类，那边是B类。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:27
msgid "在特征空间中，每个样本是一个点，分类就是画一条**决策边界**把空间切开："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:30
msgid "分类任务的决策边界"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:53
msgid "**关键洞察**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:55
msgid "边界这边聚集着同类样本"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:56
msgid "边界是\"模糊\"的（软边界），不是一刀切的硬线"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:57
msgid "新样本落在哪边，就预测为哪类"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:59
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**数学形式**：分类模型输出类别概率分布 $p(y=k|x)$，其中 $k \\in \\{1, 2, ..., "
"K\\}$。决策规则是选择概率最大的类别："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:61
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\hat{y} = \\arg\\max_k \\, p(y=k|x)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:63
msgid "决策边界是两个类别概率相等的位置：$p(y=i|x) = p(y=j|x)$。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:65
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{ref}`activation-"
"functions`中讨论的非线性激活函数，正是为了让神经网络能够学习**非线性的决策边界**。没有非线性激活，无论多少层网络都只能学习线性边界。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:69
msgid "回归任务：发现数值映射的规律"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:71
msgid "想象你在做物理实验：测量不同拉力下弹簧的伸长量。你发现\"拉力越大，弹簧伸得越长\"。这不是分类问题，因为你不是把拉力分成\"大\"或\"小\"两类，而是要找出**具体的数值关系**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:73
msgid "**回归的本质**：学习一个**函数映射**，输入一个数值，输出另一个数值。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:75
msgid "最简单的回归是**线性回归**：假设输入和输出之间是直线关系。类比：你收集了若干房屋的面积和价格数据，在纸上画散点图，然后画一条最\"拟合\"这些点的直线。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:77
msgid "**数学形式**：对于单变量线性回归"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:79
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\hat{y} = wx + b"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:81
msgid "$x$：输入特征（如房屋面积）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:82
msgid "$w$：权重（斜率，表示\"每平方米值多少钱\"）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:83
msgid "$b$：偏置（截距，表示\"基础价格\"）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:84
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\hat{y}$：预测值（预测房价）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:86
msgid "**几何意义**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:88
msgid "在二维平面上，线性回归就是找一条直线，让所有数据点到直线的**垂直距离之和最小**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:91
msgid "线性回归的几何意义"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:112
msgid "**扩展到多元**：现实中的房价不只由面积决定，还取决于位置、房龄、楼层等。多元线性回归："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:114
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\hat{y} = w_1x_1 + w_2x_2 + ... + w_dx_d + b = \\mathbf{w}^T\\mathbf{x} "
"+ b"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:116
msgid "这不再是二维平面上的直线，而是**高维空间中的超平面**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:118
msgid "**非线性回归**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:120
msgid "线性回归假设关系是直线，但很多规律是曲线。神经网络通过堆叠非线性层，可以学习**任意复杂的函数映射**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:123
msgid "从线性到非线性回归"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/task-formulations.md:146
msgid "回归 vs 分类的本质区别"
msgstr ""

